# Raspberry Pi Pico 2, RISC-V

The same hardware pico2-arm names, built for its Hazard3 cores instead of its
Cortex-M33 cores. PICO_BOARD is pico2 for both; PICO_PLATFORM is what selects the
architecture, and the bridge owns that mapping.
